      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The equation factors as \\[ x(x+4)^2(4-x)=0. \\] Its roots, counted with multiplicity, are \\(0,\\) \\(4,\\) \\(-4,\\) and \\(-4.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
